{"id":"c5828f228c59ddb1","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-absolutely-convex.md","title":"Absolutely Convex Set","display":"df-absolutely-convex — Absolutely Convex Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-absolutely-convex","aliases":["58-df-absolutely-convex"],"display":"df-absolutely-convex — Absolutely Convex Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-powerset]]","[[58-df-intersection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-absolutely-convex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-absolutely-convex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-absolutely-convex — Absolutely Convex Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"58-df-intersection\">58-df-intersection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V\">\\(X,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate on a subset and its designated real vector-space structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{absconv}_{\\mathbb R}:V^4\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{absconv}_{\\mathbb R}:V^4\\to V\\)</span> (hull operator with the same structure parameters)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}(A;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}\\;\\left(|\\alpha|+|\\beta|\\leq1\\to(\\alpha\\odot_X x)+_X(\\beta\\odot_X y)\\in A\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}(A;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}\\;\\left(|\\alpha|+|\\beta|\\leq1\\to(\\alpha\\odot_X x)+_X(\\beta\\odot_X y)\\in A\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\operatorname{absconv}_{\\mathbb R}(A;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}(C;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\operatorname{absconv}_{\\mathbb R}(A;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}(C;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Absolutely convex = convex and symmetric (balanced).</li>\n<li>Absolutely convex hull of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is the intersection of all absolutely convex sets containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Minkowski functional: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_A(x) = \\inf\\{t &gt; 0 : x \\in tA\\}\">\\(p_A(x) = \\inf\\{t &gt; 0 : x \\in tA\\}\\)</span> for absorbing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Seminnorms generate absolutely convex neighborhoods of 0.</li>\n<li>Power set and generalized intersection are listed directly because they construct the hull, rather than merely documenting the vector-space predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"fde8356a8733e94f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-intersection]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)$ (see [[58-df-vector-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{absconv}_{\\mathbb R}:V^4\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}(A;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb{R}\\;\\left(|\\alpha|+|\\beta|\\leq1\\to(\\alpha\\odot_X x)+_X(\\beta\\odot_X y)\\in A\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolutely\\text{-}convex\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\operatorname{absconv}_{\\mathbb R}(A;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq C\\land\\mathrm{AbsConv}_{\\mathbb R}(C;X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p_A(x) = \\inf\\{t > 0 : x \\in tA\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1797,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-absolutely-convex.md|58-df-absolutely-convex]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","2b6b1d9eb78a2714","fde8356a8733e94f"]}